**Summary of US-004 Implementation:**

Implemented the Partner Testimonials System with the following features:
- **Partner testimonials page** (`/dashboard/partner/testimonials`): Partners can submit testimonials with content (max 500 chars) and 1-5 star rating, view their submitted testimonials with status badges (pending/approved/featured), and edit/delete pending testimonials
- **Admin moderation page** (`/dashboard/admin/partner-testimonials`): Admin can view all testimonials with filtering (pending/approved/featured), approve testimonials (triggers email notification to partner), feature/unfeature approved testimonials, delete any testimonial, and see statistics (total, pending, approved, featured, average rating)
- **tRPC procedures**: 
  - Partner: `submitTestimonial`, `getMyTestimonials`, `updateTestimonial`, `deleteTestimonial`, `getFeaturedTestimonials` (public)
  - Admin: `getTestimonials`, `approveTestimonial`, `featureTestimonial`, `deleteTestimonial`, `getTestimonialStats`
- **Email notification**: `sendPartnerTestimonialApproved` function sends notification when testimonial is approved
